<!--
  Every page of the site, in the order the site map page lists them.

  The <loc> values are relative paths, like every other link in /site: this site has no fixed
  domain and is served from GitHub Pages under a sub-path, so a hard-coded origin here would be
  wrong for every fork and for every local copy.

  Axiom: all of the content stays reachable from the root, through the navigation and through this
  file. A page added to /site is listed here in the same change.
-->
<urlset xmlns='http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9'>
